# Put: the [ and ] marks after a put of several lines.

=== vp multi-line charwise then backtick bracket
text:
  one two three
  four five
cursor: 1,5
register a: c "x\ny"
keys: viw"ap`[
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  one x
  y three
  four five
expect-cursor: 1,5
expect-mode: normal

=== vp linewise then backtick bracket
text:
  one two three
  four five
cursor: 1,5
register a: l "x\ny\n"
keys: viw"ap`[
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  one $
  x
  y
   three
  four five
expect-cursor: 2,1
expect-mode: normal

=== Vp linewise then backtick bracket
text:
  one two three
  four five
cursor: 2,3
register a: l "x\ny\n"
keys: V"ap`[
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  one two three
  x
  y
expect-cursor: 2,1
expect-mode: normal

=== Vp charwise then backtick bracket
text:
  one two three
  four five
cursor: 2,3
register a: c "x\ny"
keys: V"ap`[
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
