  x
  y
expect-cursor: 2,1
expect-mode: normal

=== P multi-line charwise then backtick bracket
text:
  one two three
  four five
cursor: 1,5
register a: c "x\ny"
keys: "aP`[
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
